  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d6e36004-fa11-5c3e-a6e6-b20970a13557" activityNameId="ee75e24c-68e2-5c5a-b474-cf9ad920cf97" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Isobutyl acetate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Isobutyl acetate, at plant
The process "isobutyl acetate, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of isobutyl acetate from isobutanol in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with data from a similar process. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000110-19-0; 
Formula: C6H12O2; 
Synonyms: 2-methyl-1-propyl acetate; 
UUID: 0354afa5-1783-3073-b3ff-2af2f5c53990
Production of isobutyl acetate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Esterification of isobutanol
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production in the world  is around 85.000 tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0354afa5-1783-3073-b3ff-2af2f5c53990.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
